### Category - Get All
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/category

### Category - Get by id
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/category/{{categoryId}}

### Category - Create New
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Restaurants"
}

### Category - Delete by id
DELETE http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/category/{{categoryId}}

### Transaction - Get All
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/transaction

### Transaction - Get By Id
GET http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/transaction/{{transactionId}}

### Transaction - Create
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "description": "Doña Blanca",
  "amount": -1000,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### Transaction - Delete
DELETE http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/transaction/{{transactionId}}

### Transaction - Create with invalid accountId
POST http://localhost:{{port}}/api/v1/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "description": "Restaurants",
  "amount": -10000,
  "currency": "MXN",
  "accountId": "invalid-id",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}